                  "text": "Current X-Ray project ID: job-1c51b2fc-ad6c-4990-842a-50cd1aa3df33\nCreate an illustrative two-storey pavilion using your real architectural tools. It is 12 m east-west by 8 m north-south, with a rectangular footprint, four exterior walls per storey, and no internal walls. Ground level is 0 and upper level 3.6 m; each storey is 3.6 m high. Add 250 mm floor slabs at both levels and one flat roof at 7.2 m, with zero eaves. Add four 1.5 m wide x 1.5 m high windows per storey, one centred in each exterior wall with 0.9 m sill. Add one ground-floor door 1.2 m wide x 2.4 m high on the south wall clear of its window. Preserve any existing geometry. Finish with the authored model visible in solid mode and inspect its actual image. Report real counts and limitations. This is an internal conceptual model, not calibrated source reconstruction or construction approval."
                }
