        "packetId": "c56412f7-56ac-4e60-a13c-cf7ba4125697",
        "payload": {
          "content": {
            "parts": [
              {
                "text": "A two-storey illustrative pavilion model measuring 12 m by 8 m with exterior openings, floor slabs, and a flat roof is now authored and displayed in the 3D viewer in solid mode.\n\n### 🏛️ Authored Pavilion Structure\n\n```mindmap\nPavilion Design (12 m x 8 m)\n  Levels\n    Ground (0.0 m)\n    Upper Level (3.6 m)\n  Exterior Envelope\n    Ground Walls (4 exterior, 0 interior)\n    Upper Walls (4 exterior, 0 interior)\n    Flat Roof (7.2 m, zero eaves)\n  Horizontal Slabs\n    Ground Slab (250 mm)\n    Upper Slab (250 mm)\n  Openings\n    Ground Door (1.2 m x 2.4 m, South)\n    Windows (8 total, 1.5 m x 1.5 m, 0.9 m sill)\n```\n\n### 📋 Real Entity Counts and Identifiers\n\n* **Levels (2)**:\n  * Ground Level (`8a76bc99-312a-4f9a-8dd5-08515e2bf913`): Elevation 0 mm, storey height 3,600 mm.\n  * Upper Level (`4676f1a3-0167-4934-8425-4fdc333d3c08`): Elevation 3,600 mm, storey height 3,600 mm.\n* **Exterior Walls (8 total; 4 per storey; 0 internal walls)**:\n  * Ground Storey: South wall (`6bce9a7b-abdb-44e0-918a-64057c51cf46`), East wall (`6fb2662f-c56c-4a16-90c8-a1d4a2c7a66c`), North wall (`38b8617b-9944-479d-95f0-b4bb6cf4492b`), West wall (`fcb37c1f-a878-4386-bd70-68fcc3a207d1`).\n  * Upper Storey: South wall (`b1c219dd-2f43-4e74-bce1-e06d0a9935a1`), East wall (`a039c525-e70c-4239-8a41-3b3b16960cb3`), North wall (`e0b51709-e201-4d6c-b47f-279eec8a0b41`), West wall (`149c5af6-d2b9-48ab-aab4-e04fc5bcccc5`).\n* **Floor Slabs (2)**:\n  * Ground Floor Slab (`2c12097b-96fc-4cdb-a933-b0f78c127101`): 250 mm thickness, elevation 0 mm.\n  * Upper Floor Slab (`bac7669b-901f-42f6-9845-62bdff58252a`): 250 mm thickness, elevation 3,600 mm.\n* **Roof (1)**:\n  * Flat Roof (`63bb0393-d3e6-40da-a763-c555d58e2883`): 0° pitch, 0 mm eaves, hosted on Upper Level with 3,600 mm offset (top elevation 7,200 mm / 7.2 m).\n* **Openings (9 total)**:\n  * Ground South Door (`397c05f1-72ec-47ef-a543-52d75fd19fa4`, Tag `D-01`): 1,200 mm wide x 2,400 mm high, placed at offset 2,000 mm (clear of the 6,000 mm wall center).\n  * Ground Windows (4): Centred on each wall at 0.9 m sill height, 1,500 mm x 1,500 mm (South `e08536cf-2375-462a-b6c1-216f1a8b0945`, East `712b5a48-8c2e-4cbc-a860-7c093baa59a1`, North `6695253b-e0f4-4f34-87a0-610bd5a363ce`, West `63d78ae1-d4fe-4e73-bc6e-ff6de8ca33da`).\n  * Upper Windows (4): Centred on each wall at 0.9 m sill height, 1,500 mm x 1,500 mm (South `481f79a5-f81b-4669-b0c3-771eef27406d`, East `08a1cb1f-b2a5-4ef7-a1cc-4b0826aff3d6`, North `4f367a06-223c-4669-ab3d-78e1317d829a`, West `da190670-2d18-4231-a0f3-a8d1328631cf`).\n\n### 🔍 Visual Inspection and Model State\n\n* The design is mounted in the Model viewer in solid display mode under scene hash `d8e96cba...`.\n* The rendered canvas inspection confirms the two-storey 12 m x 8 m form factor, upper and lower slab planes, flat parapet edge at 7.2 m, and aligned window openings on visible facades.\n* The south entry door is situated on the south elevation clear of the central window bay.\n\n### ⚠️ Scope and Evidence Limitations\n\n* **Draft Conceptual Nature**: All entities are authored internal conceptual geometry labelled as inferred; they are not reconstructed or calibrated from a verified source drawing.\n* **Unpriced Wall Assemblies**: Walls use default layer assemblies; material compositions, acoustic ratings, thermal properties, and unit costs remain unpriced and unassigned.\n* **Non-Engineering Status**: This output is an internal draft preparation; it does not constitute structural engineering validation, building code compliance, or construction approval.",
                "thoughtSignature": ""
              }
            ],
